{"data": {"event": {"id": "32a9f21d-d0f6-49f8-8424-c78d78edf1d8", "picture": "https://services.medicalcongress.online/congress/medias/2026/JFR2026/598/video/thumbs/poster.jpg", "sessionType": "S\u00e9ance scientifique", "sessionTypeColor": "#44fc54", "voting": null, "title": "S\u00e9ance de communications orales en imagerie de l'appareil g\u00e9nital et urinaire masculin", "start": "2026-10-08T14:00+02:00", "end": "2026-10-08T15:15+02:00", "objectives": ["<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">\u00c0 l\u2019issue de cette session, les participants seront capables de :</p>", "<ol data-spread=\"true\" start=\"1\">", "\t<li><strong>Caract\u00e9riser les nodules et micronodules testiculaires en IRM</strong>, notamment lorsqu\u2019ils sont d\u00e9couverts \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9chographie sans signe \u00e9chographique de malignit\u00e9, afin d\u2019orienter leur prise en charge.</li>", "\t<li><strong>\u00c9valuer l\u2019apport des techniques d\u2019imagerie compl\u00e9mentaires dans la caract\u00e9risation des l\u00e9sions r\u00e9nales et uro-g\u00e9nitales</strong>, notamment l\u2019\u00e9chographie de contraste et les nouvelles techniques d\u2019imagerie de la microvascularisation.</li>", "\t<li><strong>Reconna\u00eetre les principales caract\u00e9ristiques d\u2019imagerie des pathologies r\u00e9nales et g\u00e9nito-urinaires rares</strong>, notamment l\u2019\u00e9pididymo-orchite tuberculeuse, les h\u00e9mangiomes r\u00e9naux et le syndrome de d\u00e9l\u00e9tion contigu\u00eb TSC2/PKD1</li>", "</ol>"], "onAir": null, "vod": {"checkPermissions": ["media:view"], "media": null}, "broadcasts": {"items": []}, "room": {"id": "12ce8395-2cd0-409b-937e-fb761e888ff4", "name": "253", "type": "ROOM"}, "schedule": {"items": [{"id": "7dd0ac5a-ba99-403a-927d-3682d96b8a39", "title": "Caract\u00e9ristiques IRM des nodules et micronodules testiculaires d\u00e9couverts \u00e0 l'\u00e9chographie sans signe suspect de malignit\u00e9", "start": "2026-10-08T14:00+02:00", "end": "2026-10-08T14:09+02:00", "